+`supersedes` (which also retires the earlier file in the same commit).
 
 ## Shape
 ```markdown
-# <title of the incident change>
-Change: <id> · Detected: <date> (<metric> at tier <n>, <rule>) · Fixed: <date>, PR #<n>
+---
+type: "Lesson"
